WEBVTT

00:02.040 --> 00:05.330
After becoming aware that he's strong enough
to go toe to toe with monsters,

00:05.330 --> 00:08.210
Helck agrees to join the
mercenary group led by Alicia.

00:08.420 --> 00:09.500
Meanwhile,

00:09.500 --> 00:12.580
Cless is severely injured as the result of
a campaign to eliminate the Demon Lord.

00:13.540 --> 00:17.580
The death of the Demon Lord makes the populace
believe that peace has finally come.

00:17.580 --> 00:21.750
But not long after, word of yet another
monster attack reaches the royal capital.

00:21.920 --> 00:23.080
Wait a second!

00:23.080 --> 00:24.500
Don't get any crazy ideas!

00:25.790 --> 00:28.580
I'm gonna go defeat the Demon Lord.

00:47.500 --> 00:50.040
Ah, displaying strength like it was totally natural

00:50.040 --> 00:52.210
Feelings of inferiority growing deeper

00:52.210 --> 00:54.170
From the moment of birth

00:54.170 --> 00:56.330
Let them know that it's a done deal

00:56.330 --> 00:58.080
The neighbor to utopia

00:58.080 --> 01:00.290
Despair is saying "hello," ya see

01:00.290 --> 01:02.330
The fact that nobody notices

01:02.330 --> 01:04.540
Is it for better or worse?

01:04.540 --> 01:07.750
No matter how many times I wake up

01:07.750 --> 01:10.880
It's like I'm in a nightmare

01:10.880 --> 01:14.250
If suffering is all there is

01:14.580 --> 01:16.380
Then God could you please

01:16.380 --> 01:20.290
Consider remaking me from scratch?

01:20.290 --> 01:22.420
Ah, for many thousands of years we have

01:22.420 --> 01:25.000
Been holding out hope for the future

01:25.000 --> 01:26.880
The end is bound to come no matter what

01:26.880 --> 01:29.170
And we try to resist it

01:29.170 --> 01:30.830
How many prayers is this now?

01:30.830 --> 01:33.170
Body and soul completely transformed

01:33.170 --> 01:37.580
Just wanting to believe in something even if it's fake

01:37.710 --> 01:41.080
Huh? Am I alive right now?

01:41.080 --> 01:43.830
I don't even know anymore

01:43.830 --> 01:45.880
Help me, I need to be saved

01:59.080 --> 02:04.000
<b>The Power of Heroes</b>

02:08.210 --> 02:11.500
That must be... the Demon Lord's castle.

02:20.710 --> 02:22.080
Is the whole place empty?

02:30.830 --> 02:32.040
These are...

02:32.630 --> 02:35.170
mannequins made to look like soldiers
from the Kingdom?

02:35.170 --> 02:37.460
But what could they be for?

02:38.210 --> 02:40.880
Someone is here.
Someone very strong.

02:41.540 --> 02:43.330
Is it the Demon Lord?

02:46.420 --> 02:49.250
Whoever it is, they must have noticed me, too.

02:56.710 --> 02:58.580
He has to be the Demon Lord!

02:59.040 --> 03:00.000
Whoa there!

03:00.000 --> 03:01.960
I highly suggest
that you don't come any closer.

03:01.960 --> 03:03.290
Hey, listen to me!

03:07.330 --> 03:08.830
I tried to warn him.

03:08.830 --> 03:10.670
Even though I'm not in top shape right now,

03:10.670 --> 03:12.830
the traps that I set
are still pretty destructive.

03:31.790 --> 03:32.830
Just surrender now!

03:32.830 --> 03:34.710
You have no hope of beating me!

03:41.790 --> 03:44.250
Why do you keep sending monsters
into our Kingdom?!

03:44.250 --> 03:45.630
What did we ever do to you?!

03:46.080 --> 03:47.960
What are you trying to accomplish?!

03:49.880 --> 03:51.630
That's a strange thing to ask.

03:52.130 --> 03:54.790
Because we aren't responsible
for spawning those monsters.

03:54.790 --> 03:55.960
They come from the land itself.

03:57.960 --> 04:00.580
But Demon Lord Thor
should have already told you all this,

04:00.580 --> 04:02.130
Hero from the human realm.

04:03.000 --> 04:04.080
Huh?

04:04.250 --> 04:06.540
Are you saying
you're not the Demon Lord?

04:06.710 --> 04:07.880
Hold on.

04:07.880 --> 04:10.750
You're not the Hero
who defeated Demon Lord Thor?

04:12.630 --> 04:14.420
I'm Helck the Mercenary!

04:14.710 --> 04:17.670
The one who fought the Demon Lord
was my younger brother, Cless!

04:17.880 --> 04:19.580
Cless the Hero!

04:24.290 --> 04:27.170
I'm one of the Empire's
Four Elite Lords, Azudra.

04:27.170 --> 04:29.210
What? There's a Demon Empire?

04:29.210 --> 04:30.210
That's right.

04:30.210 --> 04:34.080
The Demon Lord Castle that we're in right now
is just one fraction of a much larger Empire.

04:34.080 --> 04:36.540
And I'm one of the Four Elite Lords
who help rule it.

04:36.540 --> 04:38.170
"Rule" it?

04:38.170 --> 04:40.330
Does that mean you have more authority
than the Demon Lord?!

04:40.330 --> 04:41.210
Yes.

04:41.210 --> 04:43.000
But you don't have to worry.

04:43.000 --> 04:46.460
Our people have no intention
of waging war with you humans.

04:46.580 --> 04:47.920
What does that mean?

04:47.920 --> 04:51.420
Our Kingdom is under attack by an
overwhelming number of monsters right now!

04:52.130 --> 04:55.960
I can explain why there's been an uptick
in monsters in the human realm.

04:55.960 --> 04:59.380
It's all part of the fallout after
your people sieged this castle.

05:00.330 --> 05:03.210
This place was meant to curb the spread of ruin

05:03.210 --> 05:06.290
and used to have the power
to stop the monsters from spawning.

05:06.290 --> 05:08.500
No way! You can't be serious!

05:08.500 --> 05:11.000
I'm not surprised that
you find it hard to believe.

05:11.000 --> 05:14.580
Humans have regarded us as threats
for hundreds of years,

05:14.580 --> 05:17.380
because they've constantly been fed
the idea that we're evil.

05:17.380 --> 05:18.500
If that's true,

05:18.500 --> 05:20.960
then what exactly are you doing here?

05:22.080 --> 05:24.960
Well, come and let me show you.

05:28.420 --> 05:29.750
What's all this?

05:29.750 --> 05:33.580
It's a burial site for my comrades who fell
in battle after your Kingdom attacked.

05:33.580 --> 05:35.000
I know they're not the best looking graves,

05:35.000 --> 05:37.500
but I figured this was better than just
leaving them out in the elements.

05:37.500 --> 05:39.670
You did all this by yourself?

05:39.790 --> 05:42.290
I had a little help from these tree roots.

05:42.290 --> 05:46.210
Don't you despise humans
for taking the lives of your friends?

05:46.210 --> 05:47.920
Of course I do.

05:47.920 --> 05:50.460
What happened is
heart-breaking and infuriating.

05:50.460 --> 05:51.750
However,

05:51.750 --> 05:55.710
everyone here was aware of the risk
when they took up the post.

05:55.710 --> 05:57.000
I don't understand.

05:57.630 --> 06:01.830
Your Empire must have more than enough power
to crush our Kingdom like it was nothing.

06:01.830 --> 06:03.420
So why haven't you wiped us out?

06:03.420 --> 06:05.960
Well, I could give you a few reasons.

06:05.960 --> 06:07.830
But perhaps the most important is...

06:08.250 --> 06:13.290
because one day, we hope to reforge the
friendship that we once had with humankind.

06:14.500 --> 06:18.380
It came as such a shock,
I felt like I had been struck by lightning.

06:19.580 --> 06:22.460
Azudra and I continued to talk
for awhile after that.

06:22.460 --> 06:25.210
He told me about the distant past
when demonkin, or rather,

06:25.210 --> 06:29.750
when the people of the Empire actually lived
side by side in harmony with humans.

06:29.750 --> 06:33.290
But as the human realm went through
the fall and rebirth of various reigns,

06:33.290 --> 06:36.710
the existence of the Empire
was gradually forgotten.

06:36.710 --> 06:40.000
And apropos of nothing, demonkin became
regarded as the root of all evil,

06:40.000 --> 06:42.630
which lead to numerous attacks on the Empire.

06:42.630 --> 06:44.710
Many attempts to establish peace were made,

06:44.880 --> 06:46.500
but they all failed.

06:48.040 --> 06:52.290
Do you think Demon Lord Thor tried to
offer Cless a peaceful end to the fighting?

06:52.290 --> 06:53.460
I'm sure of it.

06:53.460 --> 06:54.880
He was the biggest pacifist

06:54.880 --> 06:57.170
among everyone stationed here
in the eastern region, after all.

06:57.170 --> 06:59.540
People even called him "Thor the Peacemaker."

07:00.460 --> 07:01.750
I see.

07:01.750 --> 07:06.460
Cless is an incredibly powerful warrior,
but he doesn't actually like to fight.

07:06.630 --> 07:08.580
I have no idea why he would
choose to keep going

07:08.580 --> 07:10.920
after hearing what your people had to say.

07:11.130 --> 07:12.750
It's just not something he would do.

07:12.750 --> 07:15.420
Haven't you talked with Cless yourself?

07:15.420 --> 07:17.250
The battle with the Demon Lord

07:17.250 --> 07:19.830
left him gravely injured and unconscious.

07:19.830 --> 07:21.790
And he still hasn't come to.

07:22.500 --> 07:23.790
That's unfortunate.

07:24.250 --> 07:25.290
Azudra.

07:25.290 --> 07:26.210
Hm?

07:26.210 --> 07:28.040
Is there any chance...

07:28.040 --> 07:30.920
we could still establish peace
with each other?

07:31.920 --> 07:33.170
Yes.

07:33.170 --> 07:34.630
All right.

07:34.630 --> 07:36.000
Then I'm headed back.

07:36.000 --> 07:39.000
I want to let my people know the truth
about this as soon as possible.

07:39.000 --> 07:40.130
Helck.

07:40.920 --> 07:42.920
While I was down in
the deepest part of the castle,

07:42.920 --> 07:44.830
I set up a quasi-barrier.

07:44.830 --> 07:47.830
It should help limit the number of monsters
that spawn for the time being,

07:47.830 --> 07:49.630
but be careful out there.

07:49.630 --> 07:53.250
Once a new Demon Lord arises and
this castle has all its functions restored,

07:53.250 --> 07:55.750
things will be far better
than they are right now.

07:55.750 --> 07:57.000
A new Demon Lord?

07:57.000 --> 08:00.130
That's right, we'll be holding a competition
to decide the new Demon Lord very soon.

08:00.420 --> 08:02.040
You can find me there.

08:02.040 --> 08:04.210
If something comes up, feel free to drop by.

08:04.210 --> 08:05.330
Thank you.

08:08.630 --> 08:10.250
So that's what happened.

08:10.250 --> 08:12.250
Now I understand the reason why Azudra

08:12.250 --> 08:15.250
placed a strange amount of trust
in someone like Helck.

08:15.250 --> 08:16.750
A short time later...

08:17.580 --> 08:20.580
I heard an indescribable shout
ring out from within the castle.

08:20.580 --> 08:25.000
I couldn't make out what it said,
but I know for sure that it was Azudra's voice.

08:25.290 --> 08:27.040
Thinking back,

08:27.250 --> 08:30.540
it might have been meant to cheer me on.

08:30.540 --> 08:31.330
Um, no.

08:31.330 --> 08:33.130
That was the scream
from his careless mistake.

08:35.500 --> 08:38.330
Although the monster problem
hadn't been solved,

08:38.330 --> 08:41.880
I was a little relieved to learn the
demons that we had feared so much

08:41.880 --> 08:44.000
were not actually hostile to us.

08:44.130 --> 08:45.290
But...

08:45.290 --> 08:49.170
I hesitated whether I should go ahead
and tell the citizens of the Kingdom or not.

08:49.330 --> 08:51.250
My words might not be convincing.

08:51.250 --> 08:53.540
It would be better to have a person
with actual influence

08:53.540 --> 08:55.170
make some sort of declaration instead.

08:55.290 --> 08:57.670
In which case, he's my only option...

09:13.040 --> 09:14.710
My god...

09:14.710 --> 09:17.580
How did things get so bad
at the defensive line?!

09:17.830 --> 09:19.630
What happened to my friends?

09:19.630 --> 09:20.460
Don't tell me...

09:21.500 --> 09:24.750
For a split second, I was overcome
by something I'd never felt before.

09:24.750 --> 09:27.380
It was an awful chill of foreboding.

09:28.710 --> 09:29.960
Please open up!

09:30.710 --> 09:32.790
You a survivor? Hang on a second!

09:35.880 --> 09:37.420
Please be okay...

09:37.420 --> 09:38.500
You guys!

09:38.500 --> 09:39.500
Oh!

09:40.170 --> 09:41.040
It's Helck!

09:41.040 --> 09:41.540
Yo!

09:41.540 --> 09:42.250
Helck!

09:42.250 --> 09:43.460
How goes it, Helck?

09:43.460 --> 09:44.960
Hey, welcome back.

09:45.250 --> 09:47.210
Oh... thank you.

09:47.460 --> 09:49.580
See! I told you Helck was fine.

09:49.580 --> 09:52.920
There's no way a trip to the
Demon Lord's castle would be the end of him!

09:52.920 --> 09:55.170
Who said anybody
was worried about him dying?

09:55.170 --> 09:56.000
Yeah!

09:56.000 --> 09:58.040
I figured he'd just show up
like nothing happened.

09:58.040 --> 10:00.670
The Captain was the only one of us
making a big fuss about it.

10:00.670 --> 10:02.960
Come on, dummy!
We all know the reason for that!

10:02.960 --> 10:04.670
Is everybody okay?!

10:04.670 --> 10:07.540
I came across the aftermath of
a really horrific battle on my way back...

10:07.540 --> 10:09.290
We made it through somehow.

10:09.290 --> 10:11.460
But it was a pretty dicey situation.

10:11.460 --> 10:12.830
Everybody's worse for wear.

10:12.830 --> 10:14.290
I worked myself to the bone!

10:14.290 --> 10:15.500
And even broke some!

10:17.210 --> 10:18.790
That's unusual for you guys.

10:18.920 --> 10:21.540
Why did you keep fighting
when things were so bad?

10:21.540 --> 10:23.920
It's all cuz of the dumbass nobles!

10:24.580 --> 10:28.170
The people in charge here don't know
how to manage without Cless.

10:28.170 --> 10:30.130
When things started to go south today,

10:30.130 --> 10:32.250
they chickened out
and shut the damn gates on us.

10:33.210 --> 10:37.460
As you can imagine, it forced us into a battle
that we couldn't retreat from.

10:41.540 --> 10:44.210
Edil and the Captain fought like hell.

10:44.210 --> 10:46.540
And by some miracle, we pulled through.

10:46.540 --> 10:48.670
But as for the other soldiers
and mercenaries...

10:48.670 --> 10:50.460
there were no survivors.

10:51.380 --> 10:53.750
Why the hell didn't you open the gates?!

10:53.750 --> 10:56.250
Because you were obviously at a disadvantage!

10:56.250 --> 10:59.130
We nobles have a responsibility
to keep the capital safe at all costs!

10:59.290 --> 11:01.830
Your goddamn incompetence
is what led to this disaster!

11:01.830 --> 11:03.630
Don't overstep your bounds.

11:03.630 --> 11:06.330
The lives of nobles hold far more value
than lowly commoners such as y-

11:06.330 --> 11:08.290
Nobody gives a shit about that!

11:08.290 --> 11:10.830
Calm down!
Helping the survivors comes first!

11:10.830 --> 11:12.250
Uh oh, here comes trouble!

11:12.250 --> 11:14.330
Just let it go, Captain!

11:14.500 --> 11:16.750
That was the wildest defensive line
I've ever been on.

11:16.750 --> 11:18.750
Mainly in terms of watching over the Captain.

11:18.750 --> 11:22.250
But in the end, that douche of a commander
was never held liable for what happened.

11:22.250 --> 11:24.130
He's still gonna be in charge next time.

11:24.130 --> 11:26.250
And I doubt he'll do anything
but save his own hide.

11:26.250 --> 11:29.920
Anyway, when news of that came, this time
it was Edil who started to get pissed off.

11:29.920 --> 11:32.330
He wanted to stress how much
it was hurting morale,

11:32.330 --> 11:34.080
and went with the Captain

11:34.080 --> 11:36.630
to demand that the commander face
some consequences for his actions.

11:36.630 --> 11:38.330
Well, I say screw 'em.

11:38.330 --> 11:42.080
Let's just forget all these selfish jackoffs
in the capital and go back to the countryside.

11:42.080 --> 11:44.750
Oh, come on, the whole Kingdom
will fall apart if the capital gets overrun!

11:44.750 --> 11:47.670
I mean, we can't fight
with all these injuries, anyway.

11:48.000 --> 11:49.420
Helck.

11:49.420 --> 11:52.000
Would you mind going
to check on those two for us?

11:52.000 --> 11:53.540
They're at the castle right now.

11:54.250 --> 11:57.130
Although they're in better shape than us,
they're still injured.

11:57.130 --> 11:58.540
And besides,

11:58.540 --> 12:01.080
waiting for you to come back
was hard on them.

12:01.080 --> 12:03.500
So go put their minds at ease, would ya?

12:04.500 --> 12:06.330
Damn those ignorant nobles.

12:06.330 --> 12:07.580
How dare they...

12:07.880 --> 12:10.540
They can't just treat my friends
like their lives are worthless.

12:11.670 --> 12:15.290
This kind of thing never happened
before Cless got injured.

12:15.790 --> 12:17.210
Cless...

12:17.210 --> 12:20.880
This Kingdom needs you,
now more than ever.

12:21.330 --> 12:23.670
Hurry up!
They've captured some demons!

12:23.670 --> 12:24.960
What? Seriously?!

12:24.960 --> 12:26.250
I heard they rounded up the survivors

12:26.250 --> 12:29.130
from the battle with the Demon Lord battle
and brought them back to the capital!

12:41.540 --> 12:43.710
Die, you demon bastards!

12:45.210 --> 12:46.500
Rot in Hell!

12:50.420 --> 12:51.710
This is wrong.

12:51.710 --> 12:54.380
It doesn't even matter
if they're demons or not!

12:54.380 --> 12:57.960
Nobody deserves this sort of treatment,
especially when they're tied up and helpless!

12:57.960 --> 13:00.080
How do these people live with themselves?!

13:08.540 --> 13:12.000
I knew my words wouldn't carry
enough weight, but it didn't matter.

13:12.000 --> 13:14.080
Watching those demonkin
get so horribly mistreated,

13:14.080 --> 13:16.290
made me feel like I HAD to say something.

13:16.790 --> 13:18.250
Please stop it!

13:18.250 --> 13:21.710
Decent human beings should
never commit atrocities like this!

13:24.250 --> 13:25.130
Everyone!

13:25.130 --> 13:26.250
Who cares what you think!

13:26.250 --> 13:27.210
Screw 'em!

13:27.210 --> 13:29.170
These demon scum are ruining our lives!

13:29.170 --> 13:30.170
Kill the bastards!

13:30.170 --> 13:31.250
Demons are pure evil!

13:31.250 --> 13:33.170
Anybody who takes their side is just as bad!

13:33.170 --> 13:34.250
Go jump in a lake!

13:34.250 --> 13:36.330
Please listen, the demonkin
didn't want to fight us!

13:36.330 --> 13:38.040
All they wanted was peace!

13:38.880 --> 13:39.960
That's a load of crap!

13:39.960 --> 13:41.130
Shut your goddamn mouth!

13:41.790 --> 13:43.000
Burn in Hell, heathen!

13:43.000 --> 13:44.130
Off with his head!

13:44.330 --> 13:46.290
After I stood up for the demons,

13:46.710 --> 13:49.960
the people in the crowd
could only see me as a transgressor.

13:49.960 --> 13:53.380
Their hatred was fierce.
Almost unnaturally so.

13:53.380 --> 13:56.380
Is fear really all it takes
to make people react like this?

13:56.750 --> 13:59.630
Or is this just the true nature
of human beings?

13:59.790 --> 14:02.500
You remind me of that one Hero...

14:02.790 --> 14:05.540
I guess...
there are other humans like him...

14:05.540 --> 14:06.710
Please...

14:06.710 --> 14:09.580
You have to get word...
to Lord Azudra...

14:09.920 --> 14:11.380
Among the humans...

14:11.670 --> 14:15.080
the power of the New World is lurking...

14:15.830 --> 14:18.460
I was wondering what
was causing such a commotion.

14:18.460 --> 14:19.670
Helck.

14:19.830 --> 14:21.130
Was it you?

14:21.830 --> 14:23.130
Mr. Raphaed!

14:23.540 --> 14:26.580
I see you've returned safely
from the Demon Lord's castle.

14:26.580 --> 14:30.250
As I suspected, you're more
than just an ordinary human.

14:30.250 --> 14:32.290
Mr. Raphaed... actually, I...

14:32.290 --> 14:33.880
Don't let yourself be fooled.

14:33.880 --> 14:36.380
The demonkin are crafty and despicable.

14:36.380 --> 14:38.380
They obviously took advantage
of your kind nature

14:38.380 --> 14:40.830
in an attempt to turn us against each other.

14:40.830 --> 14:42.830
Look very closely at these three.

14:45.040 --> 14:48.540
Beware... that man...!

14:49.670 --> 14:50.710
What the...

14:53.670 --> 14:56.580
This is the true form of the demonkin!

15:03.790 --> 15:04.920
It's a monster!

15:04.920 --> 15:07.580
Helck, you must never forget.

15:12.670 --> 15:14.670
They are purveyors of death and destruction.

15:15.500 --> 15:18.290
Beings of pure evil who serve only
to spread chaos throughout the world.

15:23.830 --> 15:25.540
That is what the demonkin are!

15:26.540 --> 15:27.750
Azudra!

15:27.750 --> 15:29.790
Was everything you said a lie?!

15:51.540 --> 15:52.670
Incredible.

15:52.960 --> 15:55.500
I didn't think there were any warriors
on par with Cless.

15:55.500 --> 15:59.880
Those men were blessed with the power
of heroes, just like Cless was.

15:59.880 --> 16:00.710
Holy crap!

16:00.710 --> 16:02.080
Thank god for them.

16:02.080 --> 16:04.210
The power of heroes?

16:04.750 --> 16:05.750
Helck!

16:06.750 --> 16:08.460
Alicia! Edil!

16:08.460 --> 16:11.290
We heard there were monsters
on a rampage around here.

16:11.290 --> 16:14.040
But it seems we showed up
a little too late to help.

16:14.330 --> 16:15.960
No, actually...

16:15.960 --> 16:17.130
What a relief!

16:17.130 --> 16:19.080
I'm glad you made it back in one piece.

16:19.080 --> 16:20.080
Thanks.

16:20.710 --> 16:21.920
Mr. Raphaed!

16:21.920 --> 16:22.710
About the demonkin...

16:22.710 --> 16:26.130
They're not just our problem.
They're a menace to the entire world.

16:26.290 --> 16:27.420
Listen, Helck.

16:27.420 --> 16:29.540
Don't let them lead you astray.

16:29.540 --> 16:31.080
Have faith in me.

16:34.250 --> 16:37.250
The following day,
the Kingdom made an announcement

16:37.250 --> 16:40.130
that brought despair and a ray of hope
at the same time.

16:40.130 --> 16:42.210
Though we defeated the Demon Lord,

16:42.210 --> 16:46.580
it turns out he was only a small part of a more
powerful evil that commands the Demon Realm!

16:48.080 --> 16:49.040
However!

16:49.040 --> 16:51.380
We have a secret weapon!

16:51.380 --> 16:53.250
It is known as "awakening!"

16:53.250 --> 16:56.580
All human beings have an innate power
that normally can't be tapped into!

16:56.880 --> 17:00.420
But we have successfully developed
a technique that can make us stronger

17:00.420 --> 17:03.000
by artificially awakening that power!

17:03.000 --> 17:04.130
I've seen them in action!

17:04.130 --> 17:07.380
Those warriors beat a bunch of
rampaging demons with ease!

17:07.380 --> 17:08.250
I saw it, too!

17:08.540 --> 17:10.000
I solemnly swear to you,

17:10.000 --> 17:14.080
we shall use this newfound power to wipe every
last demon off the face of this Earth!

17:14.080 --> 17:16.710
And then usher in an era of true peace!

17:17.920 --> 17:21.170
The Kingdom made it clear
they would wage war on the demonkin.

17:21.500 --> 17:23.580
In the days following that,

17:23.580 --> 17:26.210
a countless number of demons
assaulted the capital.

17:26.210 --> 17:27.290
But now,

17:27.290 --> 17:30.710
we had awakened warriors on our side
who had no trouble annihilating them.

17:31.250 --> 17:34.830
They managed to hold the defensive line
without a single casualty.

17:35.420 --> 17:36.830
The number of victims began to drop,

17:36.830 --> 17:38.920
both in the royal capital
and the Kingdom at large.

17:38.920 --> 17:42.250
And everyone could see that the situation
was definitely improving.

17:44.380 --> 17:47.630
I'm still not sure if the demonkin
are really our enemies.

17:47.920 --> 17:52.040
I just can't bring myself to believe
that everything Azudra told me was a lie.

17:52.040 --> 17:54.130
Helck! I made some coffee!

17:54.500 --> 17:57.790
At that point, I hadn't told any of my friends
about the conversation I had with Azudra.

17:57.790 --> 18:01.960
I was a little afraid to,
because I had no idea how they'd react to it.

18:03.290 --> 18:06.880
Not too long ago, we were all fighting
our asses off without even taking a break.

18:06.880 --> 18:09.420
So now it feels weird
to be relaxing like this, ya know?

18:09.420 --> 18:11.540
After those awakened soldiers showed up,

18:11.540 --> 18:13.290
we suddenly have a lot
of free time on our hands.

18:13.290 --> 18:15.750
Things have gradually gotten
more lively around town, too.

18:15.750 --> 18:18.960
Oh, that reminds me, I heard that
one restaurant has finally opened up again!

18:18.960 --> 18:22.290
Sweet! Everybody says that place
has the best pasta you'll ever eat!

18:22.290 --> 18:23.790
And it's a pretty chill place at night,

18:23.790 --> 18:26.250
which makes it perfect
for couples out on a date.

18:26.750 --> 18:29.040
Actually, I got two coupons the other day!

18:29.040 --> 18:30.920
For real?
You've got somebody to take?

18:30.920 --> 18:33.080
Afraid not. You want 'em?

18:34.000 --> 18:35.330
Nah, I'm a loner, too!

18:36.630 --> 18:38.170
Oh, hey, Captain!

18:38.170 --> 18:40.330
How about you and Helck
use them to go for dinner?

18:41.960 --> 18:43.880
Me?! And Hel- huh?!

18:43.880 --> 18:45.290
What kind of crazy talk is that?!

18:45.290 --> 18:46.330
Why not?

18:47.130 --> 18:49.250
You two should go,
it's a great opportunity!

18:49.250 --> 18:50.170
HUH?!

18:50.170 --> 18:53.040
I mean, you never know when
things might get busy for us again.

18:53.040 --> 18:54.250
That's besides the point!

18:54.250 --> 18:55.830
Why do we have to go alone?!

18:55.830 --> 18:58.170
Yeah. How about we all go together?

18:58.170 --> 19:00.710
Unfortunately, the rest of us
already have plans today!

19:00.710 --> 19:01.790
What he said.

19:01.790 --> 19:03.920
We're busy with stuff like rehab and workouts.

19:03.920 --> 19:05.130
Plus, I ain't hungry.

19:05.130 --> 19:06.630
Oh! Workouts, huh?

19:06.630 --> 19:09.000
Sounds good! Okay, count me in!

19:09.000 --> 19:10.250
Dude! Read the room!

19:10.250 --> 19:10.880
Just go!

19:10.880 --> 19:11.960
You dense musclehead!

19:11.960 --> 19:14.210
Workouts are the last thing that you need!

19:14.210 --> 19:16.750
You gotta realize
we're trying to do you a solid here.

19:18.000 --> 19:19.130
Oh, I see.

19:19.130 --> 19:21.920
They all must have realized that
something was bothering me.

19:21.920 --> 19:23.580
And instead of being open with everyone,

19:23.580 --> 19:26.960
they're giving me a chance
to talk about it with the Captain alone.

19:26.960 --> 19:29.040
Just go and have a good time with her,
ya bonehead!

19:29.040 --> 19:30.330
Here, I'll even give you my coupons!

19:30.330 --> 19:33.290
Take the hint! Come on!
There's a spark in the air!

19:34.460 --> 19:36.130
Enough! Shut your stupid faces!

19:36.130 --> 19:38.380
The next person to talk
is getting a mouthful of my sword!

19:38.380 --> 19:40.250
Yikes! The Captain just blew her top!

19:41.250 --> 19:42.880
Run for it!

19:44.210 --> 19:46.420
Shucks, I really can be stupid sometimes.

19:46.420 --> 19:48.880
Of course these are people I can trust!

19:49.420 --> 19:50.960
I should just tell them.

19:51.750 --> 19:53.460
Jeez! I can't believe them!

19:53.460 --> 19:54.460
Alicia.

19:55.330 --> 19:57.790
Would you be willing to join me
at that restaurant?

19:58.880 --> 20:00.880
Um, well...

20:00.880 --> 20:03.710
A-are you sure you want me to go with you?

20:03.710 --> 20:04.830
Absolutely.

20:07.040 --> 20:08.710
O-oh really?

20:09.540 --> 20:11.790
Then... I'd love to.

20:11.790 --> 20:13.080
Let's go.

20:13.670 --> 20:14.750
Thank you.

20:16.380 --> 20:18.750
W-well, I'm going to get changed!

20:18.750 --> 20:20.460
It would be weird to go out wearing this!

20:20.460 --> 20:21.920
Just wait for a bit!

20:21.920 --> 20:23.000
Oh, right!

20:23.000 --> 20:24.960
You should put a shirt on
or something, okay?

20:24.960 --> 20:27.290
We might get turned away at the door
with your half-naked cape look!

20:27.290 --> 20:28.880
Right! Sounds good!

20:28.880 --> 20:30.040
Wow.

20:30.040 --> 20:33.080
I don't think I've ever seen Alicia
with that big of a smile on her face.

20:33.080 --> 20:36.170
Good timing.
I should use this chance to fill Edil in, too.

20:36.170 --> 20:37.040
Edil.

20:37.040 --> 20:37.960
Yeah?

20:37.960 --> 20:39.960
If you're up for it,
I would like you to join us.

20:41.580 --> 20:43.750
It's not like you to be a scaredy-cat.

20:43.750 --> 20:44.790
Huh?

20:44.790 --> 20:47.170
You've totally got this!
Don't worry about it!

20:47.330 --> 20:48.960
Uh, okay then...

20:48.960 --> 20:50.880
Maybe he's already busy with something else.

20:53.670 --> 20:54.670
I recognize you.

20:54.670 --> 20:56.880
You're one of the warriors
who fought alongside Cless.

20:56.880 --> 20:58.670
Are you two the only ones here?

20:58.670 --> 21:01.290
No. Our Captain is in the room next door.

21:01.290 --> 21:03.080
You mean that swordswoman?

21:03.080 --> 21:04.460
Well, come on in.

21:04.460 --> 21:05.750
Thanks.

21:08.580 --> 21:09.420
Helck...

21:10.130 --> 21:13.170
Please. I really need your help.

21:24.330 --> 21:27.960
Hey, what was that dream

21:27.960 --> 21:31.170
We used to fantasize about?

21:31.790 --> 21:35.750
A treasured memory even if it's small

21:35.750 --> 21:39.170
And covered in mud

21:39.920 --> 21:43.630
I was so clumsy that

21:43.630 --> 21:46.710
I couldn't even tell left from right

21:47.670 --> 21:54.580
When those clear eyes took my hand and saved me

21:55.670 --> 21:59.540
It's okay, it's okay, you kept saying

21:59.540 --> 22:03.460
As you hugged me tightly over and over

22:03.460 --> 22:06.830
This time I will be the one to grab ahold

22:06.830 --> 22:10.040
Of your warm hand

22:11.290 --> 22:18.460
I shouted your name and the world laughed

22:18.750 --> 22:22.710
Those words that hold us together

22:22.710 --> 22:25.830
Are the most precious of all

22:26.960 --> 22:34.170
If this is going to be our fate, then let's change it

22:34.420 --> 22:38.420
On the other side of the darkness

22:38.420 --> 22:45.420
We shall seize the light together

22:46.130 --> 22:50.920
<b>Next Episode</b>

22:46.130 --> 22:50.920
<b>The Truth Behind Awakening</b>

22:46.880 --> 22:50.210
Next time: "The Truth Behind Awakening"
